## Rules are enforced by tools — read the error, fix the cause
- Type, lint and architecture errors say what to do instead and link an ADR in `docs/adr/`. Follow it.
- Do not add {{ stk.escapes_display }}.
  `ci/guardrail-ratchet.sh` counts these and fails CI if they increase.
- If a rule looks wrong for this case, STOP and explain why in the PR. Do not work around it,
  and do not justify a workaround in a comment.

